WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
What if? Loopset: process simulation. [Music and interface sound effects.]

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.233
Choose a template. Twelve editable starting points.

3
00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:16.617
Service Studio: explore shared staffing and waiting requests.

4
00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:22.150
Festival Gate: explore arrivals and queues.

5
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.850
Little Factory: explore production capacity.

6
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:31.383
