7
00:00:31.383 --> 00:00:36.917
Change one assumption. Shared specialist availability: 2 to 3. Run and compare.

8a
00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:39.717
Completed: 66 to 86. Wait: 9.5 to 5.2 min. Cost: $85 to $115.

8b
00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:42.467
Synthetic Service Studio: 106 arrivals, 1 hour, seed 4207.

9
00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:48.000
Save your own template. Reuse it for the next idea.

10
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.700
No installation. Free and open source.

11
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.383
Loopset. Try it at berkebasbay.github.io/loopset.
